The FCC test report lists the following as identical models.. *CNet CNUSB-611, USB-611 (obviously not as the CNUSB611 defines a non-dongle AT76C503A device) *MICROTEK SPA MEG552 *ISINE IS33581 *OvisLink AirLive WL-11-USB-DO *ANUBIS Typhoon DSL Wireless Home Kit - 70073 *Olidata - Italy WiFiUSB *EverBest BesTech WL111-USB *[[Fiberline FL-WL240U]] *Repotec RP-WU611
"05-01-0586-04" appears to be silkscreened on the board in the FCC photos.
